00:57:51.710 --> 00:58:03.020
<v Ira Glass>Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. Every time he and I play tennis, he makes me so mad the way he serves. And when I get mad, he always reminds me--
<v Ira Glass>像往常一样感谢我们节目的联合创始人托里·马拉蒂亚先生。每次我和他打网球，他发球的方式总是让我很生气。当我生气时，他总是提醒我——

00:58:03.020 --> 00:58:10.470
<v Torey Malatia>Quiet discussion, and decency, and courtesy. That's the way our court works.
<v Torey Malatia>安静的讨论、体面和礼貌。这就是我们法院的工作方式。

00:58:10.470 --> 00:58:15.470
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带回更多《美国生活》的故事。
